      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YARRAMUNDI CAMMO (4) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 19.70 beating Yarramundi Go Go. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Can continue on his winning ways. PADUCAH (8) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 3 lengths (19.81) at Angle Park in a Grade 5 over 342m. Has a strong record from this draw, notching two wins and seven minor placings from nine starts. Bold showing expected. ZIPPING KEYS (1) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (17.15) at this track in a Grade 6. Lines up from box 1 for the first time. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Deserves a win and gets her chance. KOOKABURRA EMILY (2) hit the frame latest (23.25) when third at this track in a Grade 6. Has already won out of this draw.",
